  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* feat(input): resolve input format from file extension by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/86\n### Bug Fixes\n* fix(cmd): suppress usage output on runtime errors by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/82\n* fix(parser): route non-object items and raw keys to the right column by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/83\n* fix(input): read stdin only when it is the intended source by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/84\n* fix(db): make file-derived table names queryable and unique by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/85\n### Other Changes\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.53.0 to 1.54.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/68\n* chore(deps): bump actions/setup-go from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/67\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.54.0 to 1.55.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/69\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.55.0 to 1.56.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/70\n* chore(doc): remove goretire card from README.md by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/71\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.56.0 to 1.57.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/72\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.57.0 to 1.58.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/73\n* README.md を更新 by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/74\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.58.0 to 1.59.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/75\n* refactor: drop an unused test helper and unexport package-local ones by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/88\n* test: drop cases that duplicate an existing code path by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/89\n* test(cmd): cover the input orchestration layer by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/87\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/compare/v0.4.1...v0.5.0\n",
